{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Bi717l2bT21795160672.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>女瑜伽導師謀殺案，其前男友裁定一項謀殺罪成，法官依例判處他終身監禁。</p><p></p><p>女瑜伽導師周慧賢，2022年6月身中逾40刀，伏屍在尖沙咀麗思卡爾頓酒店房內，終年23歲。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"PIC J.C.MURDER-1230-1_CLEAN_2.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026MqaatP1C1U1795160793.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>其前男友勞浚銘被控一項謀殺罪，現年32歲的被告否認控罪，自辯時稱因為替事主支付學費、購物，欠下巨款，但事主多次出軌，事發當晚事主指她兩度懷孕的孩子，都不是他的，失控下殺了她。五男二女陪審團周四一致裁定，被告謀殺罪成。</p><p></p><p>辯方引述被告的求情信，向事主及其親友致歉，他無保護事主，更向公眾呈現了負面的形象，被告承認錯誤，殺害了此生唯一愛過的女人。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"PIC J.C.MURDER-1230-1_CLEAN_3.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026toU0EjSOLm1795160826.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>高院法官郭啟安就指，案發時兩人已經分手，如果被告是如此深愛對方，應該放手，但用最殘忍的方式殺害對方，可以想像她在死前必然十分痛苦及極度恐懼，依例判被告終身監禁。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"PIC J.C.MURDER-1230-1_CLEAN_4.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Ogb3IdWuqx1795160854.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T08:43:57.631022+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":332,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T07:26:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T23:17:32.315808+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T08:37:18.347762+00:00","content_hash":"7482b8f107add5bf9005956e2fcad67c7a56d82812c986679c66b31f5a966082","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T08:43:57.631022+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}